<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="hero-title">在职验证</view><view>仅供内部 CRM 核验</view></view><view class="notice">演示环境请勿选择真实名片或填写可识别信息。当前原型只验证文件类型和大小，不保存文件内容、文件名、路径或说明正文。</view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">选择在职名片</view><view class="actions"><button size="mini" bindtap="chooseImage">选择图片</button><button size="mini" bindtap="chooseFile">选择文件</button></view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{selected}}">已选择合规类型文件（不显示文件名）</view><textarea class="note" placeholder="可选说明；演示环境请勿填写识别信息" value="{{note}}" bindinput="note"/><button class="button" bindtap="submit">提交内部核验</button></view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">核验记录</view><view class="status" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><text>{{item.status}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.submittedAt}}</text></view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{!items.length}}">尚无核验记录</view></view></view>
